Package: australianrent
Title: Check Rental Affordability in VIC
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person("Xuanning", "Zhang", , "xzha0419@student.monash.edu", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Quarterly median rents by Victorian local government area from
    1999 to 2025, with tools to evaluate whether a household can afford to
    rent on a given income, and a Shiny application for exploring which
    areas are affordable.
